     span<= 13: 1716 shapes; ordering measS7<=theta'<=L_y holds on 1716/1716
     #shapes where theta' STRICTLY tighter than L_y = 0
     (Q2) consec maximizes L_y?      beaters=0  -> YES  (max=0.358231)
     (Q1) consec maximizes theta'?   beaters=0  -> YES  (max=0.358231)
          consec maximizes measS7?   beaters=0   -> YES

